--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 04a7120080da2e64b9a8c9c5ffc33ba1, type: 3}
  m_Name: HandOfTheKing
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SO_DialogNPC
  _name: Hand Of The King
  _portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 64df75f9b20adac419b362721663a1ec, type: 3}
  _cards:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0eb21e65d89787f4aa02a73deaa145cf, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0502ebab851a28a41b63689b556b07da, type: 2}
  _dialogPaths:
  - entries:
    - playerText: 
      npcText: "Do you have something to say today, a vision perheaps? Hurry up\u2014I
        have much work to do as the Hand of the King."
    - playerText: 'The mariage is compromised. '
      npcText: I knew it. The king shall be informed.
    - playerText: 'The realm is compromised. '
      npcText: 'Yes, I had my doubt. I''ll take care of it. '
    - playerText: Nothing today
      npcText: 'Of what use are you? '
    - playerText: 'I don''t see you doing much. '
      npcText: 'Carreful there, remember who you are speaking to. '
    - playerText: /you refuse to answer/
      npcText: /looks like this conversation is over/
  - entries:
    - playerText: 
      npcText: The wedding is tommorrow, I dont have any time to play around with
        your vision nonsense. Hurry up.
    - playerText: The wedding is threatened by a force closer than you realize
      npcText: I will inform the King. You may not be entirely useless after all.
    - playerText: There are people plotting against the King.
      npcText: I will take care of it.
    - playerText: "I can give you some guidance\u2026 perhaps a prediction."
      npcText: Hmph. Very well. Speak quickly, but do not waste my time.
    - playerText: I don't have anything for you.
      npcText: /looks like this conversation is over/
    - playerText: "Your majesty\u2026 or should I say, oh mighty Hand, perhaps you
        could open your eyes for once?"
      npcText: "\u2026Watch your tone. I may tolerate your insight, but do not press
        your luck."
  - entries:
    - playerText: 
      npcText: "I have no time for you\u2014the wedding is today"
  - entries:
    - playerText: 
      npcText: Do not disturb me in my work.
  - entries:
    - playerText: 
      npcText: I am the Hand, commanded by the King to serve the realm.
